{"title":"2014 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A function <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/2/bb2c93730dbb48558bb3c4738c956c4e8f816437.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"13\" height=\"18\" /> satisfies <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/f/c4fe271742b4e6452c3f2ceff3b6c1cf72de5d1e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x) + f(x + 3) = 2x + 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"201\" height=\"20\" /> for all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />.<br />\nIf <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/f/73fdfffb000c5ac0b4aacee5897608129ed5e110.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(8) + f(2) = 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"135\" height=\"20\" />, determine the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/e/e3e666a10991c7006492fd948a0a240a7c380e3e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(5)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"32\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Using this, we see that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/a/e8a042a5b4c8a65d35ef0bb3f656a6b6739d46d2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(2) + f(5) = 2 \\times 2 + 5 = 4 + 5 = 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"286\" height=\"20\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/8/2/882b03bd874dd2259687452adb102cd68301e88b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(5) + f(8) = 2 \\times 5 + 5 = 10 + 5 = 15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"304\" height=\"20\" />. Adding these, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/b/c5ba6f81dc09192368a70bacf50602970edaae29.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(2) + f(5) + f(5) + f(8) = 9 + 15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"279\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/f/5/af58e4321b5d75606392148800d256c06d424e93.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(2) + f(8) + 2f(5) = 24$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"200\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/9/579d111aaa36a3f391200c979e919dd412f4f85c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2f(5) + 12 = 24$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"128\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/6/1/8618378a12c38e4177e36bcbce31b775a651f577.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2f(5) = 24 - 12 = 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"170\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/2/8a2a2e0dce4c40bfff9e45dba3db524da9085942.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(5) = \\frac{12}{2} = \\boxed{6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"127\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can realize if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/9/2593a5aac2ac3f0bce25639dacaf8db416fd2daa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x) = x + 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"103\" height=\"20\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/9/57979f3fd45e11e89a55f383470d78eb79170bb1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x) + f(x + 3) = x + 1 + x + 4 = 2x + 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"331\" height=\"20\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/c/a/3ca0888b6e2c386c0697fed327ca1ecc6cd07d17.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(8) + f(2) = 9 + 3 = 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"199\" height=\"20\" />. This satisfies our properties so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/9/2f9e3a0ded594c404121a8784e879d8d118a08ac.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(5) = 5 + 1 = \\boxed{6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"145\" height=\"25\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CSMC\" title=\"2014 CSMC\">2014 CSMC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CSMC_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CSMC Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CSMC_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CSMC Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_3\" title=\"2014 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 3\">Part A Problem 3</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 5 (page does not exist)\">Part A Problem 5</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_1\" title=\"2014 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 1\">Part A 1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_2\" title=\"2014 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 2\">Part A 2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_3\" title=\"2014 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 3\">Part A 3</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Part A 4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 5 (page does not exist)\">Part A 5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 6 (page does not exist)\">Part A 6</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_1\" title=\"2014 CSMC Problems/Part B Problem 1\">Part B 1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CSMC Problems/Part B Problem 2 (page does not exist)\">Part B 2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CSMC Problems/Part B Problem 3 (page does not exist)\">Part B 3</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CEMC_Senior_Competition\" title=\"CEMC Senior Competition\">CEMC Senior Competition</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018060300\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.020 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.027 seconds\nPreprocessor vis